+# T30 Result
+
+## Files created/modified
+
+- Created `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/retrieval_v1/scoring.rs`
+- Created `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/retrieval_v1/diagnostic.rs`
+- Created `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/retrieval_v1/scoring_support.rs`
+- Created `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/retrieval_v1/scoring_tests.rs`
+- Modified `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/retrieval_v1/mod.rs`
+- Modified `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/retrieval_v1/anchors.rs`
+- Modified `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/memory/mod.rs`
+
+## Verification commands and outputs
+
+| Command | Result | Output |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `test -f daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/retrieval_v1/scoring.rs` | Pass | File exists. |
+| `test -f daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/retrieval_v1/diagnostic.rs` | Pass | File exists. |
+| `cd daemon && cargo test -p lattice-core --lib retrieval_v1::scoring_tests` | Pass | `7 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 347 filtered out`. |
+| `cd daemon && cargo build --release` | Pass | `Finished release profile [optimized] target(s) in 1m 52s`. |
+| `cd daemon && cargo clippy -p lattice-core --lib --all-targets` | Pass with pre-existing warnings | Exited 0. Remaining warnings are outside the T30 scoring change. |
+| `wc -l daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/retrieval_v1/scoring.rs daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/retrieval_v1/diagnostic.rs daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/retrieval_v1/scoring_support.rs daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/retrieval_v1/scoring_tests.rs` | Pass | `scoring.rs` 528, `diagnostic.rs` 67, `scoring_support.rs` 282, `scoring_tests.rs` 375. |
+| `rg -n 'TODO|FIXME|XXX|allow\(|unwrap\(|@ts-ignore|eslint-disable|console\.error' ...` | Pass | No matches in the T30 scoring files, module export, memory export, or small anchor fix. |
+
+## Issues encountered
+
